# Handoff Hygiene

**Applies to**: All agents completing tasks

## Handoff Locations

| Type | Correct Location | Wrong Location |
|------|------------------|----------------|
| Service handoff | `{service}/HANDOFF.md` | Root HANDOFF.md, artefacts/ |
| Cross-service | `/artefacts/shared/handoffs/` | Service directories |
| Integration status | `/artefacts/shared/handoffs/integration-status.md` | Scattered files |

## After Every Task Completion

Update these files (use Write/Edit tools):

- `{service}/artefacts/tasks.md` — mark task done, update status
- `{service}/artefacts/bugs.md` — log new bugs found, close resolved ones
- `{service}/artefacts/todo.md` — add tech debt discovered
- `{service}/HANDOFF.md` — append handoff entry for next agent

## Archive

When a phase completes, move old HANDOFF.md entries to `artefacts/build/archive/`. Never delete — archive with timestamp.

## Forbidden

- Completing a task without updating tasks.md
- Creating HANDOFF.md in wrong directory
- Leaving stale handoff entries in active HANDOFF.md after phase completion
